WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-reelshort-6a3f6465934d3e8b110840c2 — Episode 21 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-28 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:13.850
Lily, why is my lunch cold today?

2
00:00:13.850 --> 00:00:15.350
I'm sorry, Madam.

3
00:00:15.350 --> 00:00:19.350
Supervisor Sophia said the kitchen is busy preparing ingredients for the dinner banquet,

4
00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:21.350
and there's no time to make a hot meal just for you.

5
00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:23.350
What do you mean?

6
00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:26.350
Hot mana employs hundreds of servants.

7
00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:28.850
Are you telling me they can't even make one decent lunch?

8
00:00:28.850 --> 00:00:30.350
I wouldn't know, Madam.

9
00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:32.350
I only follow Supervisor Sophia's orders.

10
00:00:32.350 --> 00:00:36.350
If it were Arthur or Vincent at sitting here today, would you serve them this kind of food too?

11
00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:40.350
Mr. Arthur is on a business trip, and Young Master Vincillet never eats lunch at home.

12
00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:43.350
Madam, please just make do with it.

13
00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:45.350
Is that so?

14
00:00:45.350 --> 00:00:47.350
Young Master Vincent...

15
00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:54.470
Where's my lunch?

16
00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:56.470
What? You didn't prepare any for me?

17
00:00:56.470 --> 00:01:08.880
Is the Hart family going bankrupt?

18
00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:10.880
How dare you serve us this rubbish!
